@startuml F7.7-D01-listar-audit-log
title F7.7-D01 — Listar trilha de auditoria
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "AuditController" as Ctrl
participant "ListAuditLogUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: /admin/audit-log
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /admin/audit-log
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT page DESC
Postgres --> UC: eventos + payloads
UC --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  Drawer/diff no client;
  sem links de mutação
end note
WebApp --> Admin: tabela imutável

@enduml
